---
// src/components/PSEO.astro
---

<section class="w-full py-24 md:py-32 bg-slate-50/50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
        
        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
                Programmatic SEO (pSEO) built right in.
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed">
                Most websites are just digital brochures. We build scalable engines. Our pSEO architecture automatically creates highly-targeted local pages to capture free Google traffic.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-[2rem] p-8 shadow-sm">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
                    <i data-lucide="layout-template" class="w-6 h-6 text-slate-700"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">1. The Core Site</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed">
                    We build one ultra-fast, high-converting core website that serves as the foundation for your brand and primary ad traffic.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border border-[#2563EB]/20 rounded-[2rem] p-8 shadow-[0_10px_30px_-10px_rgba(37,99,235,0.08)]">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#2563EB]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
                    <i data-lucide="copy-check" class="w-6 h-6 text-[#2563EB]"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">2. Programmatic Expansion</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed">
                    We programmatically generate <strong class="text-slate-900">10 perfectly optimized local pages</strong> (e.g., "Plumber in PJ") targeting your specific areas.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-[2rem] p-8 shadow-sm">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
                    <i data-lucide="magnet" class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-600"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">3. Long-Term Free Leads</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed">
                    Over time, Google indexes these local pages. You start capturing highly motivated, free organic search traffic locally.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>